WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 10.3 · Legal, Compliance, Policies & Risk
Contracts and agreements

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
You will sign agreements before you are fully set up: check each one before you sign.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Check who signs: before registering, it may bind you personally.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Say in the text whether a memorandum is binding.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Keep one register with dates and signed copies.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You set up a contracts register and a pre-signature checklist.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
